  "totalBlocks": 52,
  "translatedBlocks": 52,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89ef5735ed7564ef",
      "translationZh": "近几个月来，Falcon、(Open-)LLaMA、X-Gen、StarCoder 或 RedPajama 等开源大语言模型取得了长足进步，在某些用例中已经能够与 ChatGPT 或 GPT4 等闭源模型竞争。然而，如何以高效、优化的方式部署这些模型，仍然是一项挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02e9f4d686d344e9",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将向你展示如何将开源大语言模型部署到 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints，这是我们提供的托管式 SaaS 解决方案，可让模型部署变得轻松。此外，我们还将教你如何以流式方式传输响应，以及测试我们端点的性能。现在就开始吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8a42c0dd11552a6",
      "translationZh": "如何部署 Falcon 40B instruct",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e0c924c73123b88",
      "translationZh": "测试大语言模型端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c61523f1a1c4b37",
      "translationZh": "在 Javascript 和 Python 中以流式方式传输响应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fed29fd80f156df",
      "translationZh": "在开始之前，让我们回顾一下有关 Inference Endpoints 的知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e68c1fa86cf5e9cc",
      "translationZh": "什么是 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f1d28f29d89e10b",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 提供了一种简单、安全的方式，可将机器学习模型部署到生产环境中使用。借助 Inference Endpoints，开发者和数据科学家都可以在无需管理基础设施的情况下创建 AI 应用：只需点击几下即可完成部署，包括通过自动扩缩容处理大量请求、通过缩容至零降低基础设施成本，以及提供高级安全保障。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25556cbcd09b11f7",
      "translationZh": "以下是部署 LLM 时最重要的一些功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ab491bbd472923c",
      "translationZh": "轻松部署：只需点击几下，即可将模型部署为生产就绪的 API，无需处理基础设施或 MLOps。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ee51ef91986142c",
      "translationZh": "成本效益：利用自动缩容至零的能力，在端点未使用时缩减基础设施规模以降低成本，同时根据端点的运行时间付费，确保成本效益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee1dc794003cc4d8",
      "translationZh": "企业级安全：将模型部署在安全的离线端点中，仅可通过直接 VPC 连接访问；具备 SOC2 Type 2 认证，并提供 BAA 和 GDPR 数据处理协议，以增强数据安全性与合规性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83004e869cd0f1ae",
      "translationZh": "LLM 优化：针对 LLM 进行优化，借助 Paged Attention 实现高吞吐量，并通过 Text Generation Inference 支持的自定义 transformers 代码和 Flash Attention 实现低延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d3f7d9fa5a25746",
      "translationZh": "全面的任务支持：开箱即用地支持 🤗 Transformers、Sentence-Transformers 和 Diffusers 的任务与模型，并可轻松定制，以支持说话人分离等高级任务，或任何机器学习任务和库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b9c60818249a940",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过以下地址开始使用 Inference Endpoints：https://ui.endpoints.huggingface.co/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "593e2b0e4a2bf03e",
      "translationZh": "1. 如何部署 Falcon 40B instruct",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4ab12b886237655",
      "translationZh": "首先，你需要使用已登记付款方式的用户或组织账户登录（你可以在此处添加付款方式），然后访问 Inference Endpoints：https://ui.endpoints.huggingface.co",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f916631b0d68a8d0",
      "translationZh": "然后，点击“New endpoint”。选择仓库、云平台和区域，调整实例及安全设置，然后部署模型；在我们的示例中，部署的是 tiiuae/falcon-40b-instruct。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "949fe5b75f5a56ab",
      "translationZh": "Inference Endpoints 会根据模型大小推荐一种实例类型，其容量应该足以运行该模型。这里推荐的是 4x NVIDIA T4 GPUs。为了让 LLM 获得最佳性能，请将实例更改为 GPU [xlarge] · 1x Nvidia A100。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2869af300e5489fa",
      "translationZh": "注意：如果无法选择该实例类型，你需要联系我们并申请实例配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48b069f3291a06e8",
      "translationZh": "然后，你只需点击“Create Endpoint”即可部署模型。10 分钟后，端点应该就会上线，可以处理请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3d7c03087dc28f69",
      "translationZh": "2. 测试 LLM 端点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e21ed82832255ed",
      "translationZh": "端点概览提供了 Inference Widget 的访问入口，你可以使用它手动发送请求。这样，你就能使用不同的输入快速测试端点，并与团队成员共享。这些小组件不支持参数，因此在这种情况下，生成的内容会比较“短”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4c0b383339155a5",
      "translationZh": "该小组件还会生成一条可供你使用的 cURL 命令。只需添加你的 hf_xxx 即可进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b11860c94e0d6c59",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用不同的参数来控制生成过程，并在请求载荷的 parameters 属性中定义这些参数。截至目前，支持以下参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "66cab00f87299883",
      "translationZh": "temperature：控制模型的随机性。较低的值会使模型更具确定性，较高的值则会使模型更具随机性。默认值为 1.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f9ebb84cbeb31b2",
      "translationZh": "max_new_tokens：要生成的最大词元数。默认值为 20，最大值为 512。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8921d1f1c4f2bee",
      "translationZh": "repetition_penalty：控制重复的可能性。默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c1893ec8a3a3c2c",
      "translationZh": "seed：用于随机生成的种子。默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2101d928c7e01ba5",
      "translationZh": "stop：用于停止生成的词元列表。当生成其中任意一个词元时，生成过程就会停止。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7ee36df2f8481b9f",
      "translationZh": "top_k：在 top-k-filtering 中要保留的概率最高的词表词元数量。默认值为 null，表示禁用 top-k-filtering。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87fce0b06fd3eaee",
      "translationZh": "top_p：用于核采样时要保留的概率最高的词表词元的累积概率参数，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9a51a515fa0ba54",
      "translationZh": "do_sample：是否使用采样；否则使用贪心解码。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b119795d78d00e96",
      "translationZh": "best_of：生成 best_of 个序列，并返回 token 对数概率最高的那个，默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcc2084abce35df3",
      "translationZh": "details：是否返回生成过程的详细信息。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b811601966008b7",
      "translationZh": "return_full_text：是返回完整文本，还是仅返回生成的部分。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3bd42a074bee009",
      "translationZh": "truncate：是否将输入截断至模型的最大长度。默认值为 true。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6cb6e67fe0b60c2",
      "translationZh": "typical_p：token 的典型概率。默认值为 null。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cc59a6848dd83b5",
      "translationZh": "watermark：生成时使用的水印。默认值为 false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a3b4abf4257de558",
      "translationZh": "3. 在 Javascript 和 Python 中流式返回响应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35436ff04db13f75",
      "translationZh": "使用 LLM 请求和生成文本可能是一个耗时且需要反复迭代的过程。改善用户体验的一个好方法，是在词元生成时就以流式方式传输给用户。下面是使用 Python 和 JavaScript 流式传输词元的两个示例。对于 Python，我们将使用 Text Generation Inference 的客户端；对于 JavaScript，则使用 HuggingFace.js 库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ad7cc85422b1380d",
      "translationZh": "使用 Python 发起流式请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e0442787cf4ee73",
      "translationZh": "首先，你需要安装 huggingface_hub 库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55ced9e44800c50d",
      "translationZh": "我们可以通过提供端点 URL、凭据以及想要使用的超参数来创建一个 InferenceClient。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "543d64c057c564b5",
      "translationZh": "将 print 命令替换为 yield，或替换为你希望将词元流式传输到的函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "da0b77bc4ad827d9",
      "translationZh": "使用 JavaScript 发起流式请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdc0f99de83b6211",
      "translationZh": "首先，你需要安装 @huggingface/inference 库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3effb9474a720a6",
      "translationZh": "我们可以通过提供端点 URL、凭据以及想要使用的超参数来创建一个 HfInferenceEndpoint。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "452e99e04b22fee2",
      "translationZh": "将 process.stdout 调用替换为 yield，或替换为你希望将词元以流式方式传入的函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6524da59e9598789",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们向你展示了如何使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints 部署开源大语言模型，如何通过高级参数控制文本生成，以及如何将响应以流式方式传输到 Python 或 JavaScript 客户端，以改善用户体验。使用 Hugging Face Inference Endpoints，你只需点击几下，就能将模型部署为生产就绪的 API，通过自动缩容至零来降低成本，并将模型部署到由 SOC2 Type 2 认证提供保障的安全离线端点中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d56adfaff91acdc",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如果你有任何问题，欢迎通过 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 联系我。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
